# Existing .pert plans should normally be maintained through perttool commands; direct DSL editing bypasses goal/DAG owner-confirmation checks.
project V3_STAGE_TRIAL:
  version 5
  title "First two-character V3 Stage battle trial"
  description "Current owner policy: unreleased production/Stage shared environment; first Google-owner V3 game use. Requirements v3 supersede first-trial legacy compatibility/history preservation, email and backup/restore gates. Preserve new V3 correctness and owner authentication. vt104 minimal deployment/detail candidate -> vt105 deployment -> vt106 authoring and vt108 old unfinished disposal -> vt107 observed game. Remaining internal estimates vt1040.5-1.25h, Stage1.75-4.75h low; external waits separate. Actual local tests retained without claiming Stage pass. Existing measured velocity25p/17h is one declared elapsed sample, not person effort. docs/character-v3-battle-cutover-requirements-v3.md; owner unreleased shared-environment policy and plan correction 2026-09-30; docs/evidence/vt104-unreleased-trial-rescope-2026-09-30.md Registration PR151 created; security CI blocks on existing undici7.29.0. Exact two-manifest7.29.1 candidate locally passes audit0/build/worker/typecheck/tests112; owner scope extension pending. Cloud readback inventory18unfinished and22outbox including14finished; no cloud writes. Latest checkpoint docs/evidence/vt104-registration-blocker-and-fix-2026-10-01.md."
  as_of 2026-09-29
  duration_unit point
  velocity 25p/17h
  finish VST_PLAYED
  goal_owner user
  dag_owner user

milestone VST_LOCAL_CANDIDATES:
  title "Two local V3 candidate fixtures exist"
  description "Neva and Rio deterministic V3 content originated on codex/v3-stage-trial-candidate at 77ed6a0 and was integrated into cc304 for vt101. Exact owner content acceptance and Stage registration remain separate."
  state reached

resource DEV:
  title "Developer"
  capacity 1

resource OWNER:
  title "Product and release owner"
  capacity 1

milestone VST_CURRENT:
  title "Accepted V3 revisions register and select through the reusable authoring path"
  description "Exact candidate review and owner confirmation bind receipts and content digest; immutable append and CAS activation with rollback and readback work through the SQLite/PostgreSQL repository contract. Neva and Rio fixed candidates can exercise the same path locally; real Stage activation belongs to vt106."
  state reached

milestone VST_BOUND:
  title "Immutable V3 battle lifecycle and local cutover verified"

milestone VST_WIRED:
  title "Registration and battle paths are ready to integrate"

milestone VST_LOCAL_BATTLE:
  title "Neva versus Rio completes a local V3 battle"

milestone VST_RELEASE:
  title "Exact trial release candidate is reviewed and identified"

milestone VST_STAGE_DEPLOYED:
  title "Trial release is deployed to Stage and read back"

milestone VST_STAGE_READY:
  title "Both V3 characters are available in Stage"

milestone VST_PLAYED:
  title "Owner has tried a real V3-versus-V3 Stage battle"

